Reinstall BusyBox and Rebuild System Symlinks Inside Chroot

1. Re-install BusyBox applets across system directories:

`busybox --install -s /bin`
`busybox --install -s /sbin`
`busybox --install -s /usr/bin`
`busybox --install -s /usr/sbin`

2. Explicitly symlink critical shell binaries to BusyBox:

`ln -sf /bin/busybox /bin/sh`
`ln -sf /bin/busybox /bin/bash`

3. Verify key applet symlinks:

`ls -l /bin/sh`
`ls -l /bin/ls`

4. Test core functionality inside the environment:

`busybox | head -n 10`
